Implementation Notes
File Structure
/src
  /pages
    - index-carbon.astro (new homepage)
    - style-switcher.astro (A/B testing tool)
  /layouts
    - CarbonLayout.astro (new base layout)
  /components
    - CarbonHeader.jsx (React navigation)
    - CarbonFooter.astro (footer component)
    - NetworkMapPinsCarbon.astro (animated map)
  /styles
    - global-carbon.css (Carbon-specific styles)
Preservation Strategy

Original design fully preserved in parallel files
Easy switching between styles for A/B testing
No data loss or functionality reduction
Simple rollback if needed

Conclusion
This design system positions USRad as a modern, trustworthy healthcare technology company while maintaining the medical credibility essential to our market. The clean aesthetic reduces cognitive load, allowing users to focus on our core value proposition: quality medical imaging at transparent, affordable prices, available when patients need it.
The system is built for growth, easily accommodating new features and content while maintaining visual consistency. Most importantly, every design decision serves our primary goal: making it as easy as possible for patients to get the medical imaging they need at prices they can afford.